WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.207
Week 5: Location, Condition, and Existence. locate a place describe a temporary condition say what is available

2
00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:20.855
Operational objective. By the end of this section you can locate a place, describe a temporary condition, say what is available. The focus is useful performance, not isolated terminology.

3
00:00:20.855 --> 00:00:28.934
Language system. Estar for location and condition; hay for existence; ser versus estar; basic prepositions.

4
00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:36.587
Sound and delivery. Spanish b/v share sounds; avoid the English v in neutral connected speech.

5
00:00:36.587 --> 00:00:46.013
Core principle. Notice meaning first, then form. Retrieve the new language aloud, compare it with the model, and repair one feature at a time.

6
00:00:46.013 --> 00:01:10.735
Model language. La farmacia está cerca de la plaza. — The pharmacy is near the square. Hay un banco delante del hotel. — There is a bank in front of the hotel. El museo está cerrado hoy. — The museum is closed today. ¿Dónde están los baños? — Where are the restrooms? La reunión es en la sala azul. — The meeting is in the blue room.

7
00:01:10.735 --> 00:01:20.654
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
